        "reason": "memory-ordering modes whose difference from volatile only a stress harness such as JCStress could show, never a unit test"
      },
      {
        "id": "virtual-pinning",
        "says": "In Java 21 a virtual thread that blocks inside synchronized pins its carrier, so ReentrantLock is preferred there.",
        "basis": [
